// Cisco Sniffing | T1040 | https://github.com/SigmaHQ/sigma/blob/master/rules/network/cisco/aaa/cisco_cli_net_sniff.yml
*monitor\ capture\ point* OR *set\ span* OR *set\ rspan*

// Stellar Cyber Query Builder (DSL):
{
  "query": {
    "bool": {
      "must": [
        {
          "query_string": {
            "query": "*monitor\\ capture\\ point* OR *set\\ span* OR *set\\ rspan*",
            "analyze_wildcard": true
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  }
}
